And, yes, she killed janet.

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:01.095
Awful, awful business, of course,

00:10:01.254 --> 00:10:03.752
But that's all over now.

00:10:04.527 --> 00:10:08.517
And think about what
book club has gotten us, hmm?

00:10:08.745 --> 00:10:10.821
