00:10:16.623 --> 00:10:19.730
My home pottery business
is finally taking off,

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:22.132
and you want to just stop?

00:10:23.082 --> 00:10:25.610
Do you want to stop?

00:10:28.119 --> 00:10:30.532
Okay. Now, come on.
We don't have much time.

00:10:30.533 --> 00:10:33.725
Ron gets back from his
fantasy football in an hour.

00:10:42.368 --> 00:10:45.663
Book of shadows, we kneel before you.

00:10:45.664 --> 00:10:48.903
Let us serve your master as you serve us.

00:10:49.096 --> 00:10:52.345
Book of shadows, we kneel before you.

00:10:52.419 --> 00:10:54.810
Let us serve your master...

