00:11:12.457 --> 00:11:15.909
I'm, uh, detective bachman,
and this is detective turner.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.210
Hiya.

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:19.221
We're following up
on amanda burns' death.

00:11:19.223 --> 00:11:21.954
Going around the neighborhood,
talking to her neighbors.

00:11:21.955 --> 00:11:24.885
But didn't she... I mean,
she killed herself, right?

00:11:24.887 --> 00:11:28.240
- Maybe, maybe.
- We heard you were friends with the deceased, right?

00:11:28.269 --> 00:11:29.940
Yeah, i guess so.

00:11:30.291 --> 00:11:32.810
Do you have any idea about her practices?

00:11:33.014 --> 00:11:35.440
I'm sorry? What... What kind of practices?

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:38.110
Well, her house was littered
with satanic paraphernalia.

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:42.700
- It was a regular black sabbath.
- No, th... But she was an episcopalian.

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:47.250
Well, then we're pretty sure
she was using the wrong bible.

00:11:49.076 --> 00:11:50.509
Elizabeth.

00:11:51.846 --> 00:11:53.377
Are you all right?

00:11:53.378 --> 00:11:56.139
I'm fine.Uh, renee, these are detectives.

00:11:56.169 --> 00:12:00.269
- They say amanda was... She was practicing...
- Sorry, detectives.

00:12:00.269 --> 00:12:03.917
You can tell that elizabeth is a little upset.

00:12:04.356 --> 00:12:06.066
Of course, miss...

00:12:06.075 --> 00:12:10.649
Mrs.Renee van allen.

00:12:11.663 --> 00:12:13.841
Would you like me to spell it for you?

00:12:13.842 --> 00:12:15.794
I'll get by, thanks.

00:12:16.105 --> 00:12:19.374
This amanda business has been hard for liz,

00:12:19.595 --> 00:12:21.087
For all of us.

00:12:21.153 --> 00:12:24.370
Yeah, i mean, you think you know a person.

00:12:27.039 --> 00:12:29.269
Well, i guess we all have secrets, don't we?

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:35.125
Well, thanks. Um, we'll be in touch.

00:12:35.238 --> 00:12:36.975
Have a nice day.

00:12:37.079 --> 00:12:38.341
Bye.

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:56.378
Well, i'm already sold on
that elizabeth chick.

00:12:56.379 --> 00:12:58.623
Did you see that victory garden of hers?

00:12:58.624 --> 00:13:01.346
Belladonna, wolfsbane, mandrake.

00:13:01.473 --> 00:13:04.496
