00:13:04.497 --> 00:13:06.870
Well, she's definitely had
a good run lately.

00:13:06.909 --> 00:13:11.639
Gone up a few tax brackets,
won almost too many raffles...

00:13:11.669 --> 00:13:14.128
The kind of thing a little black
magic always helps with.

00:13:14.156 --> 00:13:15.377
Yeah.

00:13:15.398 --> 00:13:20.584
I don't think she's alone, either.
It looks like mrs.Renee van allen

00:13:20.586 --> 00:13:24.055
