she's entered in the past three months.

00:13:24.056 --> 00:13:27.420
A regular martha stewart, huh?
Except for the devil worship.

00:13:27.433 --> 00:13:30.814
I'm thinking that was the coven
we met back there, minus one member.

00:13:30.862 --> 00:13:33.322
Amanda was clearly going off
the reservation.

00:13:33.323 --> 00:13:35.740
You think they killed her
to keep up appearances?

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:37.709
Seems like an appearance kind
of crowd, don't you think?

00:13:37.711 --> 00:13:38.545
Yeah.

00:13:38.546 --> 00:13:42.010
If they killed a nut job,
should we thank them or what?

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:44.883
They work in black magic, too, dean.
They need to be stopped.

00:13:46.222 --> 00:13:48.139
Stopped, like stopped?

00:13:49.504 --> 00:13:52.099
- They're human, sam.
- They're murderers.

00:13:56.041 --> 00:13:57.840
Burn, witch, burn.

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:15.136
Ruby.

00:14:15.137 --> 00:14:16.890
Sam, listen to me. There's no time.

00:14:16.891 --> 00:14:19.770
