00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.582
So, this is ruby, huh?

00:14:21.771 --> 00:14:24.859
- Never had the pleasure.
- Dean. I was hoping you'd show up again.

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:27.040
Point that thing somewhere else.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:28.420
Right.

00:14:28.421 --> 00:14:30.262
Sam, please. Go.

00:14:30.365 --> 00:14:32.939
Get in the car and don't look back.

00:14:32.969 --> 00:14:35.832
