00:14:46.629 --> 00:14:47.939
Demons.

00:14:49.675 --> 00:14:52.010
- They get their power from demons.
- Yeah.

00:14:52.731 --> 00:14:56.416
- And there's one here now.
- Oh, what, you mean besides you?

00:14:56.417 --> 00:14:58.735
Sam, it knows you're in town,
and it's gonna come after you,

00:14:58.736 --> 00:15:02.568
- and it's way more than you can handle.
- Oh, come on. What is this, huh?

00:15:02.569 --> 00:15:04.495
Please tell me you're not
listening to this crap.

00:15:04.495 --> 00:15:06.918
Put a leash on your brother, sam,
if you want to keep him.

00:15:06.936 --> 00:15:09.016
- Dean, just chill out.
- No! No!

00:15:09.017 --> 00:15:12.157
She's messing with your head!
God knows why. That's who they are!

00:15:12.158 --> 00:15:14.673
- I'm telling you the truth.
- I'm telling you to shut up, bitch!

00:15:14.674 --> 00:15:17.198
I'm sorry. Why are you even
a part of this conversation?

00:15:17.199 --> 00:15:20.074
Maybe because he's my brother,
you black-Eyed skank!

00:15:20.075 --> 00:15:22.572
<i>Oh, right, right. And you care
about your brother so much.</i>

00:15:22.573 --> 00:15:25.004
That's why you're checking out,
leaving him all alone.

00:15:25.004 --> 00:15:26.789
- Shut up.
- Let me try and save him

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:28.376
since you won't be here
to do it anymore.

00:15:28.377 --> 00:15:30.610
- I said shut up!
- Dean, no!

00:15:47.560 --> 00:15:49.485
What the hell were you thinking?

00:15:49.486 --> 00:15:51.636
What? What the hell was i thinking?

00:15:51.637 --> 00:15:55.504
She's a demon, sam, period. All right?
They want us dead. We want them dead.

00:15:55.505 --> 00:15:57.978
Oh, that's funny. I remember
that demon chick in ohio...

00:15:57.979 --> 00:16:00.219
- Casey... You didn't want her dead.
- Well, she wasn't stringing

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:02.245
me along like a fish on a hook.

00:16:02.246 --> 00:16:04.620
No one's stringing me along!

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:09.820
Look, i know it's dangerous
that she is dangerous

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:14.302
- but like it or not, she's useful.
- No! We kill her before she kills us.

00:16:14.302 --> 00:16:17.938
Kill her with what?
The gun she fixed for us?

00:16:17.939 --> 00:16:20.283
- Whatever works.
- Dean, if she wants us dead,

00:16:20.283 --> 00:16:22.790
all she has to do is
stop saving our lives.

00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:25.043
Look, we have to start looking
at the big picture, dean.

00:16:25.043 --> 00:16:28.442
start thinking in strategies
and and moves ahead.

00:16:28.443 --> 00:16:31.927
It's not so simple. We're not
just hunting anymore.

00:16:31.946 --> 00:16:33.851
We're at war.

00:16:36.849 --> 00:16:38.661
Are you feeling okay?

00:16:39.177 --> 00:16:41.092
Why are you always asking me that?

00:16:41.093 --> 00:16:44.027
Because you're taking advice
from a demon, for starters.

00:16:44.029 --> 00:16:46.875
And, by the way, you seem less
and less worried about offing people.

00:16:46.876 --> 00:16:49.927
- It used to eat you up inside.
- And what has that gotten me?

00:16:50.022 --> 00:16:52.575
Nothing, but it's just want
you're supposed to do, okay?

00:16:52.598 --> 00:16:55.836
We're supposed to drive in the freaking
car and freaking argue about this stuff!

00:16:55.837 --> 00:16:58.521
You go on about the sanctity
of life and all that crap.

00:16:58.552 --> 00:17:02.290
Wait, so you're mad because i'm
starting to agree with you?

